# supercronic schedule for the tile job (see Dockerfile).
# Nightly: Geofabrik publishes daily diffs, and a full tilemaker run over the
# configured federal districts takes hours, so anything more frequent would
# just overlap itself. A night with no new diffs costs only the state.txt
# fetches - both the tileset build and the ocean build are skip-if-current.
0 2 * * * cd /app && /opt/otm-venv/bin/python -m tilesvc
